"""
Engine-generator: Lecture 2's mapped engine and a Lecture 4 DC-equivalent machine running as a
generator on one shaft, with the converter that delivers its power to a DC bus at `p` and `n`.

    engine -> shaft -> machine -> converter -> p, n
    engine and machine housings -> support

The unit takes two commands, the electrical power it delivers, `P_ref` [W], and the shaft speed,
`N_ref` [rpm], and holds both with two loops that share the shaft:

    tau_ref = -unload P_em / sqrt(w^2 + w_min^2)        P_em = P_ref + P_trim
    unload  = clamp((w - w_ref + dw_unload) / (dw_unload / 2))
    dP_trim/dt = (P_ref - P_elec) / T_P + (P_held - P_em) / T_aw_P
    pedal   = clamp(K_N (w_ref - w) + x_N)   dx_N/dt = K_N (w_ref - w) / T_N + (pedal - u) / T_aw

The generator holds the power. Its torque request is the air-gap power it has to convert over
the shaft speed: the command plus an integrator, `P_trim`, that makes up the copper and converter
losses, so the power at the pins, not at the air gap, settles on `P_ref`. The converter's current
loop acts within milliseconds, and for any positive command the generator only brakes, so the
unit never motors its engine and can feed a passive load. Past the converter's current limit, or
while unloading (below), the generator converts less than `P_em`; that power, `P_held`, is fed
back into the trim (back-calculation), so the trim stays bounded and lets go as soon as the
command is back in reach. The engine holds the speed: it is the only source on the shaft, so it
has to make up whatever the generator takes. More power demanded first slows the shaft, and the
speed loop's PI opens the pedal until the engine torque matches. The pedal is clamped smoothly
to [0, 1], with the same back-calculation, so a command beyond full load does not wind the loop
up either.

`N_ref` is an engine speed. `P_shaft`, the engine power the unit needs in steady state, `P_em`
plus the generator's friction, iron, windage and constant losses, is an output, so a best-BSFC
operating line (`Vehicle.OperatingLine`) driven from it puts the engine on the line whatever the
generator's losses.

The power has priority only while the engine keeps up. The generator's current limit is worth
more torque than the engine's full load, so a command the engine cannot make would pull the
shaft down to a stall. Once the shaft falls more than `dw_unload / 2` below its command, `unload`
backs the generator off, to nothing at `dw_unload` below; the unit then delivers what the engine
makes at full load, a little under the commanded speed.

The bus at `p` and `n` has to set its own voltage: a battery does, and so does a capacitor across
a load. Across a bare resistor the bus voltage is algebraic, and the converter's equations then
also hold at a negative or a near-zero bus voltage, which the initialization can land on. The run
starts delivering its command at the commanded speed, with the generator current at its command
and the engine at `pedal_start` and `p_m_start`; the speed loop settles within a few seconds. The
engine's brake-booster hose is capped.

The generator follows `HybridDrive`'s scaling of the Lecture 4 Leaf machine, sized to the engine
rather than to the Sonata's 30 kW: 30 kW cannot absorb the engine's 32 kW best-BSFC point at
3000 rpm with any margin, nor the 50 kW further up the line. Source tags: (derived) computed from
other numbers, method given; (assumed) the course's choice.
"""
component EngineGenerator
  "Commanded electrical power delivered at the pins [W], positive generating (assumed command convention)"
  P_ref = RealInput() {^P_ref}
  "Commanded engine speed [rpm] (assumed; the OperatingLine output unit)"
  N_ref = RealInput() {^N_ref}
  "DC bus, positive rail (derived; Converter p_in)"
  p = Pin() {^p}
  "DC bus, negative rail (derived; Converter n)"
  n = Pin() {^n}
  "Engine mounts and generator housing (derived; MappedEngine and DCMachine support)"
  support = Spline() {^support}
  "Fuel mass flow [kg/s] (derived; MappedEngine output)"
  mdot_fuel = RealOutput() {^mdot_fuel}
  "Shaft speed [rpm] (derived; generator rotor speed)"
  N = RealOutput() {^N}
  "Electrical power delivered at the pins [W] (derived; bus voltage times current out of p)"
  P_elec = RealOutput() {^P_elec}
  "Engine power the unit needs in steady state: air-gap power plus the generator's shaft losses [W] (derived)"
  P_shaft = RealOutput() {^P_shaft}

  "Generator peak shaft torque (derived; above the Lecture 2 engine's 150.2 N.m full-load peak, rounded up)"
  parameter T_max::Torque = 160.0
  "Generator rated shaft power (assumed; holds the best-BSFC line up to about 55 kW electrical)"
  parameter P_rated::Power = 60.0e3
  "Generator corner speed, rated power divided by peak torque, about 3580 rpm (derived)"
  parameter w_base::AngularVelocity = P_rated / T_max
  "Generator design voltage, the 270 V bus of HybridDrive (assumed; ORNL-2011 Sonata pack)"
  parameter V_nom::Voltage = 270.0
  "Size factor relative to the Lecture 4 110 kW Leaf (derived; P_rated / 110 kW)"
  parameter size_scale::Real = P_rated / 110.0e3
  "Armature resistance (derived; Leaf scaling, Leaf R times (V_nom/350)^2 / size_scale)"
  parameter R::Resistance = 0.05 * (V_nom / 350.0) ^ 2 / size_scale
  "Inductance preserving the Leaf 10 ms electrical time constant (derived; L = 0.01 R)"
  parameter L::Inductance = 0.01 * R
  "Rotor inertia (derived; Leaf 0.05 kg.m2 times size_scale, assumed similarity)"
  parameter J::Inertia = 0.05 * size_scale
  "Bearing friction torque (derived; Leaf 0.5 N.m times size_scale, assumed similarity)"
  parameter T_f::Torque = 0.5 * size_scale
  "Iron-loss torque (derived; Leaf 1 N.m times size_scale, assumed similarity)"
  parameter K_i::Torque = 1.0 * size_scale
  "Windage coefficient (derived; Leaf coefficient times size_scale, assumed similarity at equal speed)"
  parameter k_w::Real = 300.0 / (10100.0 * pi / 30.0) ^ 3 * size_scale
  "Constant shaft loss (derived; Leaf 200 W times size_scale, assumed similarity)"
  parameter C::Power = 200.0 * size_scale
  "Low-speed loss regularization, retained from Lecture 4 (assumed)"
  parameter w_reg::AngularVelocity = 10.0
  "Maximum duty, no voltage boost (assumed; Lecture 4)"
  parameter d_max::Real = 1.0
  "Current-loop time constant (assumed; Lecture 4)"
  parameter T_i::Time = 1.0e-3
  "Converter conduction drop (assumed; Lecture 4)"
  parameter V_on::Voltage = 1.2
  "Switching frequency (assumed; Lecture 4 Leaf setting)"
  parameter f_s::Frequency = 5.0e3
  "Switching-edge duration (assumed; Lecture 4)"
  parameter t_sw::Time = 1.0e-6
  "Field/duty corner rounding (assumed; Lecture 4 numerical regularization)"
  parameter eps::Real = 1.0e-4
  "Power-trim time constant: the loss make-up settles in a few T_P (assumed)"
  parameter T_P::Time = 0.2
  "Under-speed band: the generator unloads as the shaft falls from half of it to all of it below command, 190 rpm (assumed; beyond the speed loop's excursions on the bench's ramps)"
  parameter dw_unload::AngularVelocity = 20.0
  "Power-trim anti-windup tracking time (assumed; shorter than T_P)"
  parameter T_aw_P::Time = 0.05
  "Speed below which the torque request stops rising as 1/w, keeping it finite at standstill (assumed)"
  parameter w_min::AngularVelocity = 10.0
  "Speed-loop gain, pedal per rad/s of speed error [s/rad] (assumed; tuned on the bench)"
  parameter K_N::Real = 0.01
  "Speed-loop integral time (assumed; tuned on the bench)"
  parameter T_N::Time = 0.5
  "Pedal anti-windup tracking time (assumed; shorter than T_N)"
  parameter T_aw::Time = 0.1
  "Pedal clamp rounding width (assumed; DisconnectClutch smooth clamp)"
  parameter clamp_width::Real = 0.001
  "Pedal at t = 0 (assumed; part load)"
  parameter pedal_start::Real = 0.2
  "Manifold pressure at t = 0 (assumed; part load)"
  parameter p_m_start::Pressure = 50.0e3

  engine = VehicleSystemsComponents.Vehicle.Engine.MappedEngine() {^engine}
  machine = VehicleSystemsComponents.Vehicle.Electric.DCMachine(field_weakening = true, T_max = T_max, w_base = w_base, V_nom = V_nom, R = R, L = L, J = J, T_f = T_f, K_i = K_i, k_w = k_w, C = C, w_reg = w_reg) {^machine}
  converter = VehicleSystemsComponents.Vehicle.Electric.Converter(I_max = (T_max + machine.tau_loss_base) / machine.k, d_max = d_max, T_i = T_i, V_on = V_on, f_s = f_s, t_sw = t_sw, eps = eps) {^converter}

  "Shaft speed command [rad/s]"
  variable w_ref::AngularVelocity
  "Loss make-up added to the power command [W]"
  variable P_trim::Power
  "Generator torque request, positive motoring [N.m]"
  variable tau_ref::Torque
  "Shaft speed lag, scaled so that 0 is fully unloaded and 1 fully loaded"
  variable a_unload::Real
  "Generator load fraction, 1 normally, falling to 0 when the shaft lags its command"
  variable unload::Real
  "Air-gap power the generator is asked to convert, command plus loss trim [W]"
  variable P_em::Power
  "Air-gap power the generator converts at the converter's limited current [W]"
  variable P_held::Power
  "Speed-loop integrator state, in pedal units"
  variable x_N::Real
  "Speed-loop output before the clamp"
  variable u::Real
  "Pedal sent to the engine, 0 closed to 1 fully open"
  variable pedal::Real
relations
  connect(engine.spline, machine.spline) {^shaft_wire}
  connect(engine.support, machine.support, support) {^mount_wire}
  connect(converter.p_out, machine.p) {^machine_wire}
  connect(converter.field, machine.field) {^field_wire}
  connect(converter.p_in, p) {^bus_p_wire}
  connect(converter.n, machine.n, n) {^bus_n_wire}
  connect(engine.mdot_fuel, mdot_fuel) {^fuel_wire}
  w_ref = N_ref * pi / 30
  P_em = P_ref + P_trim
  P_shaft = P_em + machine.P_fric + machine.P_iron + machine.P_wind + machine.P_const
  a_unload = (machine.w - w_ref + dw_unload) / (dw_unload / 2)
  unload = 0.5 * (1 + sqrt(a_unload ^ 2 + clamp_width ^ 2) - sqrt((a_unload - 1) ^ 2 + clamp_width ^ 2))
  tau_ref = -unload * P_em / sqrt(machine.w ^ 2 + w_min ^ 2)
  P_held = -converter.i_cmd * converter.field * machine.k * sqrt(machine.w ^ 2 + w_min ^ 2)
  der(P_trim) = (P_ref - P_elec) / T_P + (P_held - P_em) / T_aw_P
  converter.i_ref = tau_ref / (converter.field * machine.k)
  u = K_N * (w_ref - machine.w) + x_N
  pedal = 0.5 * (1 + sqrt(u ^ 2 + clamp_width ^ 2) - sqrt((u - 1) ^ 2 + clamp_width ^ 2))
  der(x_N) = K_N * (w_ref - machine.w) / T_N + (pedal - u) / T_aw
  engine.pedal = pedal
  N = machine.w * 30 / pi
  P_elec = -(p.v - n.v) * p.i
  initial engine.crankshaft.phi = 0.0
  initial engine.crankshaft.w = w_ref
  initial engine.air.manifold.p = p_m_start
  initial converter.i_out = converter.i_cmd
  initial P_elec = P_ref
  initial x_N = pedal_start
  guess converter.field = 1.0
  guess converter.d = 0.5
  guess p.v = V_nom
  guess engine.crankshaft.w = 200.0
metadata {
  "Dyad": {"icons": {"default": "dyad://VehicleSystemsComponents/Vehicle/Engine/MappedEngine.svg"}, "labels": [{"label": "$(instance)", "x": 500, "y": 1100, "rot": 0}]},
  "_links": {
    "P_ref": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": -50, "y1": 250, "x2": 50, "y2": 350}, "diagram": {"x1": -50, "y1": 150, "x2": 50, "y2": 250}}}},
    "N_ref": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": -50, "y1": 650, "x2": 50, "y2": 750}, "diagram": {"x1": -50, "y1": 650, "x2": 50, "y2": 750}}}},
    "p": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "pos", "x1": 950, "y1": 150, "x2": 1050, "y2": 250}, "diagram": {"iconName": "pos", "x1": 950, "y1": 150, "x2": 1050, "y2": 250}}}},
    "n": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "neg", "x1": 950, "y1": 750, "x2": 1050, "y2": 850}, "diagram": {"iconName": "neg", "x1": 950, "y1": 750, "x2": 1050, "y2": 850}}}},
    "support": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "support", "x1": 450, "y1": 950, "x2": 550, "y2": 1050}, "diagram": {"iconName": "support", "x1": 450, "y1": 950, "x2": 550, "y2": 1050}}}},
    "mdot_fuel": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": 150, "y1": -50, "x2": 250, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}, "diagram": {"x1": 150, "y1": -50, "x2": 250, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}}}},
    "N": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": 450, "y1": -50, "x2": 550, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}, "diagram": {"x1": 450, "y1": -50, "x2": 550, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}}}},
    "P_elec": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": 650, "y1": -50, "x2": 750, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}, "diagram": {"x1": 650, "y1": -50, "x2": 750, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}}}},
    "P_shaft": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": 850, "y1": -50, "x2": 950, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}, "diagram": {"x1": 850, "y1": -50, "x2": 950, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}}}},
    "engine": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 120, "y1": 360, "x2": 300, "y2": 540}}}},
    "machine": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 420, "y1": 360, "x2": 600, "y2": 540}}}},
    "converter": {"Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 700, "y1": 360, "x2": 880, "y2": 540}}}},
    "shaft_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}]}},
    "mount_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 210, "y": 800}], "E": -1}, {"S": 2, "M": [], "E": -1}, {"S": -1, "M": [], "E": 3}], "junctions": [{"x": 510, "y": 800}]}},
    "machine_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}]}},
    "field_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 900, "y": 486}, {"x": 900, "y": 600}, {"x": 640, "y": 600}], "E": 2}]}},
    "bus_p_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 680, "y": 200}], "E": 2}]}},
    "bus_n_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 790, "y": 800}], "E": -1}, {"S": 2, "M": [{"x": 620, "y": 800}], "E": -1}, {"S": -1, "M": [], "E": 3}], "junctions": [{"x": 790, "y": 800}]}},
    "fuel_wire": {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 200, "y": 300}], "E": 2}]}}
  }
}
end
